Step 6: Create GitHub Repository
Open GitHub .

Create a repository named student-flask-app.

Open the terminal in your project folder.

Run these commands:


bash
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Add Flask Docker application"
git branch -M main
git remote add origin https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/student-flask-app.git
git push -u origin main







